<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Valuk</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">fl. c. 631</span> · <a href="/centuries/7th-century">7th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Valuk is the first known ruler of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/slavs">Slavs</a> of Carantania, mentioned in the chronicle of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chronicle-of-fredegar">Fredegar</a> as 'duke of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/wends">Wends</a>' around 631. He was probably allied with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/samo">Samo</a>, whose tribal union resisted the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/avars">Avars</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/frankish-kingdom">Franks</a>. Fredegar records that he gave refuge to a group of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bulgars">Bulgars</a> fleeing the Avars.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/valuk.jpg" alt="Valuk" width="320" height="212" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Migg00 at English Wikipedia · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Valuk_2.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
